WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A fictional archipelago data commons. Share resilience knowledge with provenance and community governance.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Every place, steward, and dataset is invented.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Model capacity, dependency, and asset metadata.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Preserve asserted provenance and permissions.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
CARE is context—not community authorization.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
No real island, community, or sovereignty claim.
